    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d700-a2">

                <pb facs="0814" n="808" xml:id="pg808"/>

                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1942-06-06">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">June</hi> 6</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">The President of the Yugoslav Government</hi>:</p>
                <p>The people in Montenegro and Sandjak in their general uprising against the
                    Communists have entirely cleaned two regions. The people have been provoked by
                    the incredible terror of the Communists who have killed thousands of
                    Nationalists. I have received photographs and documents of their atrocities. I
                    am proceeding now to the reorganization of those regions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mihajlović</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
